  "prefLabel": "Jus 412.02 Form NHCT-50 Authorization for Electronic Filing by Agent",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 412.02 Form NHCT-50 Authorization for Electronic Filing by Agent.\n\n(a) Form NHCT-50 shall be signed in ink on behalf of a charitable trust by one of the following:\n\n(1) A trustee if the charitable trust is an express trust;\n\n(2) The presiding officer or treasurer of the governing board; or\n\n(3) If the organization is not New Hampshire-based, the executive director of the organization.\n\n(b) Form NHCT-50 shall be signed in ink on behalf of fundraising counsel or a paid solicitor by an officer of the fundraising counsel or paid solicitor.\n\nSource. #13455, eff 10-7-22; ss by #14162, eff 12-27-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/jus400.html"
